Keeper auth / caller-allowlist / pause branches live in KeeperExecutorBase.tree.

StrategyKeeperExecutor::constructor(address registry_)
└── It should default policy knobs, lastSyncAt = block.timestamp, and version "2.1.0-mimic"

StrategyKeeperExecutor::perform(uint8 action) — called by the allowlisted automation account
├── Given action is Rebalance
│   ├── It should rebalance when a strategy reports unhealthy
│   └── It should revert with KeeperExecutorNoUpkeepNeeded when all strategies are healthy
├── Given action is WithdrawShortfall
│   ├── It should withdraw the live shortfall from strategies to the Controller
│   └── It should revert with KeeperExecutorNoUpkeepNeeded when needs are covered
├── Given action is DepositExcess
│   ├── It should deploy idle Controller ETH above the reserve to strategies
│   ├── It should cap at the strategy maxDeposit and emit the actual amount
│   └── It should revert with KeeperExecutorNoUpkeepNeeded when nothing is excess
├── Given action is HarvestPerformanceFees
│   ├── It should mint pending fees to the DAO treasury above minHarvestETH
│   └── It should revert with KeeperExecutorNoUpkeepNeeded below the floor / when fees are off
├── Given action is Sync
│   ├── It should sync after syncInterval elapses and rate-limit thereafter
│   └── It should revert with KeeperExecutorNoUpkeepNeeded within the interval / when interval is 0
├── Given action is ProvideExitLiquidity
│   ├── It should top the AMM float up to exitLiquidityTargetETH from idle Controller ETH
│   └── It should revert with KeeperExecutorNoUpkeepNeeded when target is 0 / already met
├── Given action is None / unknown
│   └── It should revert with KeeperExecutorUnknownAction
└── Given msg.sender is not allowlisted
    └── It should revert with KeeperExecutorUnauthorizedCaller / KeeperExecutorNoAllowedCallers

StrategyKeeperExecutor::checker()
├── It should return (false, "") when strategyUpkeepStatus() is None
└── It should return (true, abi.encodeCall(this.perform, (uint8(action)))) mirroring strategyUpkeepStatus()
    (execPayload is the exact calldata perform accepts — verified by executing it as the proxy)

StrategyKeeperExecutor::strategyUpkeepStatus() priority
├── It should return Rebalance over every funding action (repairs the NAV source)
├── It should return ProvideExitLiquidity over DepositExcess
├── It should return None when the executor / Controller / StrategyManager is paused
└── It should re-derive amounts from live state — reports never carry authoritative amounts

StrategyKeeperExecutor::pendingRedemptionNeedsETH()
├── It should anchor the scan at QueueKeeperExecutor.nextLiveBatchIdToProcess() (the two
│   executors must agree on which batch is next, or reserved ETH drifts)
├── It should not count the unpriced current batch
└── It should count priced batches inside MAX_BATCH_PROCESSING_TIME

StrategyKeeperExecutor::setControllerReserveETH / setExitLiquidityTargetETH / setSyncInterval / setMinWithdrawETH
└── It should enforce ADMIN_ROLE and accept 0 as a meaningful explicit choice

StrategyKeeperExecutor::setMinDepositETH / setMinHarvestETH / setMinExitLiquidityTopUpETH
└── It should enforce ADMIN_ROLE and reject 0 (dust floors must stay non-zero)
